# Operations Manager (OM) role

| Product name | DB role id | Branch assignment |
|---|---|---|
| **Operations Manager** | `OPERATIONS_MANAGER` | HQ sentinel → **All Branches (organization)** |

## Access

- Can use header **All Branches** + filter to one clinic
- **Employee (My*)**: My Attendance, My Leave, My Training, My Commission & Sales, My Salary, 2M Milestone
- **Clinic ops** (same modules as Clinic Manager): Dashboard, Scheduling, Sales, Catalog, Customers, Forms, Leave Approvals, Staff list, Plan B, Branch Sales / Payment Channels / Branch Attendance
- **HQ operations extras**: Warehouse, Stock Transfers (plus franchise/branch orders, expenses, waste already in CM ops)
- **Not** full HQ: no User Access CRUD, no Branches directory CRUD, no Marketing campaigns admin
- **Not** HR people-ops owner: no Recruitment / New Hires / Exits / org Salary / KPIs / Deductions modules

## Implementation notes

- Frontend: `isOperationsManagerRole`, `canAccessClinicOps`, `canAccessHqOps`, `RequireOperationsAdmin`, `buildOperationsManagerNavSections`
- Create account: role `OPERATIONS_MANAGER` → branch locks to **All Branches (organization)**
- Migration: `20261018000092_operations_manager_role.sql`
